  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/tokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Homestead/BH_Homestead_promo2.webp\" alt=\"BisectHosting\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qHB5D9uzHe\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d126ae4be2a40425b3b4c8a772552f7c140b2e66.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tameableminisheep\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a80caa35a2c844341d4b4580d8ebf7b6972ed307.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/tokimi\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/950513659899780d3fd677f8907af80a2c1a440d.png\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n\n曾經想馴服「[[Let's Do] WilderNature](https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-wildernature)」模組中的迷你羊嗎？現在你可以了！\n\n感謝 https://modrinth.com/user/thecolonel63 協助製作\n\n### 功能特色：\n\n- 迷你羊現在可以用草來馴服！（準確來說是剪下的草！）[不是高草]\n- 你可以為迷你羊裝上鞍，像騎馬一樣騎乘牠！\n- 就這樣。牠超級可愛。",
